WEBVTT

01:29.270 --> 01:34.400
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.740 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 12]

01:44.280 --> 01:46.210
It doesn't look good. Take it away.

01:46.600 --> 01:47.110
Right.

01:48.229 --> 01:49.400
Yours is crooked.

01:49.420 --> 01:50.680
Right. Straighten it.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.640
Xixiao.

01:55.640 --> 01:56.840
When did you get back?

01:57.590 --> 01:59.479
I invited some of your dad's friends

01:59.479 --> 02:01.280
from academia tonight.

02:01.300 --> 02:02.960
Do you want to stay for dinner?

02:02.980 --> 02:04.810
I'll pass. I have no appetite.

02:07.600 --> 02:08.400
But I do have something

02:08.400 --> 02:09.860
I want to talk to you about.

02:10.590 --> 02:11.680
Zhou Wan's mother.

02:12.920 --> 02:14.250
What do you really want?

02:15.150 --> 02:16.560
Let me talk to you instead.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.360
Don't make things hard

02:17.360 --> 02:18.560
for Zhou Wan anymore.

02:19.079 --> 02:21.380
So if I agree to go abroad now,

02:22.220 --> 02:23.890
and you marry into the Lu family,

02:23.890 --> 02:25.420
will you give her the money?

02:33.880 --> 02:36.910
[Inpatient Building]

02:47.440 --> 02:48.000
Mom.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.800
I came to see you again.

02:53.420 --> 02:54.820
How are you doing lately?

02:56.430 --> 02:57.960
Are you feeling any better?

02:58.490 --> 03:00.420
I'd be discharged if I were better.

03:02.850 --> 03:04.550
I'm getting old.

03:05.120 --> 03:06.320
Recovery takes time.

03:14.750 --> 03:15.310
Mom.

03:16.890 --> 03:18.920
It's my fault these past few years.

03:20.590 --> 03:22.829
I'm useless.

03:23.630 --> 03:25.360
Haven't been able to help much.

03:28.760 --> 03:29.790
You don't need to.

03:30.840 --> 03:31.710
It's not easy for you

03:31.710 --> 03:32.840
to maintain your current life

03:32.840 --> 03:34.100
either.

03:34.430 --> 03:36.360
Just take good care of yourself.

03:37.200 --> 03:38.400
Don't worry about me.

03:38.829 --> 03:40.410
How could I not worry?

03:40.790 --> 03:42.210
If I could help out,

03:42.670 --> 03:43.870
then Wan wouldn't...

03:52.200 --> 03:53.320
What about Wan?

03:55.860 --> 03:57.040
Didn't she tell you?

03:59.460 --> 04:00.710
What is it?

04:02.280 --> 04:04.080
Forget it, Mom.

04:04.720 --> 04:06.280
This girl has grown up.

04:06.310 --> 04:07.640
She's got her own mind.

04:07.810 --> 04:09.330
No one can talk her out of them.

04:09.330 --> 04:09.860
Wait.

04:11.050 --> 04:12.450
What exactly is going on?

04:12.970 --> 04:14.650
It's really nothing, Mom.

04:15.670 --> 04:16.670
-Go to sleep.
-No.

04:16.670 --> 04:18.450
You... You make it clear.

04:18.940 --> 04:21.430
Even if you're not her mother anymore,

04:21.709 --> 04:23.350
I'm still her Grandma.

04:23.750 --> 04:24.720
Don't leave me hanging.

04:24.720 --> 04:25.750
Make yourself clear.

04:25.750 --> 04:26.800
I need to know what it is first

04:26.800 --> 04:29.410
-so I know how serious it is.
-Okay. Alright.

04:29.430 --> 04:31.230
Don't... Don't get too excited.

04:33.830 --> 04:34.740
Listen,

04:35.620 --> 04:37.550
dating isn't a big deal

04:37.570 --> 04:38.850
at her age.

04:39.730 --> 04:41.440
But the boy she's with, Lu,

04:43.420 --> 04:44.950
comes from a wealthy family

04:45.070 --> 04:46.159
and is a real rich kid.

04:46.159 --> 04:47.760
I'm afraid she'll be fooled.

04:49.390 --> 04:50.360
Lu?

04:51.940 --> 04:53.350
You mean Lu Xixiao?

04:54.409 --> 04:55.670
I know that kid.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.190
You know him?

04:57.340 --> 04:58.180
Yes.

04:58.350 --> 04:59.840
He's got good character.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.800
Well...

05:13.890 --> 05:15.630
Maybe we'll wait and see.

05:16.900 --> 05:18.820
If they really work out,

05:18.840 --> 05:20.910
it'd be like childhood sweethearts.

05:21.860 --> 05:23.100
I'm just worried.

05:23.190 --> 05:24.280
I'm afraid

05:24.300 --> 05:26.160
that she's with him for the money.

05:28.270 --> 05:30.390
That's true. Well,

05:31.970 --> 05:35.490
why would Wan need money?

05:36.770 --> 05:38.370
What would she need money for

05:38.370 --> 05:39.170
anyway?

05:39.190 --> 05:39.990
It's useless.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.040
Right, Mom?

05:51.000 --> 05:52.420
Good character, huh.

06:13.160 --> 06:14.070
I heard you passed

06:14.070 --> 06:15.720
Professor Qin's exam.

06:16.670 --> 06:18.400
At least you got one thing done.

06:18.670 --> 06:20.080
Prepare well from now on.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.000
I'm not going

06:21.000 --> 06:22.530
to Professor Qin's school.

06:23.680 --> 06:24.270
Didn't you want me

06:24.270 --> 06:25.670
to study finance abroad?

06:27.060 --> 06:27.770
I agree.

06:35.250 --> 06:36.780
No other conditions?

06:37.550 --> 06:39.350
Just get my mom's painting back.

06:41.030 --> 06:41.960
That's it?

06:45.070 --> 06:47.000
Get out. Close the door behind you.

06:55.500 --> 06:56.300
Done talking?

06:57.159 --> 06:58.020
What about you?

06:59.450 --> 07:02.040
That's not a small sum of money,

07:02.380 --> 07:03.800
but I'll have it ready.

07:04.770 --> 07:06.080
You can't blame me.

07:06.420 --> 07:07.750
I'm not kicking you out.

07:08.760 --> 07:11.410
Studying finance abroad is a great thing.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.440
The family's paved the way for you.

07:13.440 --> 07:14.490
It's an opportunity

07:14.490 --> 07:16.160
-so many people would kill for.
-Please. Stop acting

07:16.160 --> 07:17.490
in front of me, will you?

07:17.640 --> 07:19.440
When will you keep your promise?

07:21.440 --> 07:22.700
What are you talking about?

07:22.700 --> 07:23.960
Since when am I acting?

07:26.480 --> 07:29.480
I'll transfer the money
as soon as you get on the plane.

07:29.700 --> 07:32.070
We're going to be mother and son soon.

07:32.100 --> 07:33.730
We should have some trust.

07:35.260 --> 07:36.850
If outsiders ever

07:36.880 --> 07:39.210
found out about my relationship with Wan,

07:39.510 --> 07:40.480
it wouldn't

07:40.480 --> 07:42.000
be good for her either.

07:50.680 --> 07:53.390
[Party B: Zhou Wan]

08:39.000 --> 08:40.789
The money will be in your account

08:40.789 --> 08:42.110
in a couple days.

08:42.200 --> 08:43.030
Remember to check.

08:43.030 --> 08:44.560
What are you talking about?

08:45.190 --> 08:46.850
I'm saying you've got skills.

08:47.140 --> 08:48.670
You actually pulled it off.

08:49.440 --> 08:51.340
Pulled what off? Say it clearly.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.470
Lu Xixiao is going abroad.

08:53.720 --> 08:54.730
Didn't you know?

09:17.860 --> 09:19.620
[Zhou Wan]

09:28.120 --> 09:29.010
Hello,

09:29.030 --> 09:31.560
the number you have dialed
is currently un...

09:34.660 --> 09:36.140
Good boy, Doggie.

09:36.730 --> 09:38.350
Wan, Doggie can shake hands now.

09:38.350 --> 09:39.010
Wanna try?

09:39.210 --> 09:40.860
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

09:39.970 --> 09:40.740
Wan!

10:27.530 --> 10:28.470
Lu Xixiao,

10:29.020 --> 10:30.280
where exactly are you?

10:52.700 --> 10:56.260
[Inpatient Building]

11:06.670 --> 11:07.510
Be more careful.

11:07.510 --> 11:09.000
You're holding a knife.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.320
Don't cut your hand.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.600
I'm not a three-year-old.

11:13.080 --> 11:13.750
You've been knitting

11:13.750 --> 11:15.050
all afternoon.

11:15.510 --> 11:17.790
It's summer. Take a break.

11:18.900 --> 11:19.750
You have no idea

11:19.750 --> 11:21.820
how boring it is in the hospital.

11:21.990 --> 11:23.510
At least knitting this scarf

11:23.510 --> 11:24.940
keeps me occupied.

11:25.750 --> 11:28.270
You know, 30 years ago,

11:28.290 --> 11:29.210
I would stand for

11:29.210 --> 11:31.200
8 hours straight at work

11:31.390 --> 11:33.200
without getting tired.

11:33.200 --> 11:35.630
You were a model worker.

11:37.250 --> 11:38.250
I've said that?

11:38.960 --> 11:40.120
I can memorize it.

11:43.420 --> 11:44.960
But it's still a long time

11:45.270 --> 11:46.270
before winter.

11:46.790 --> 11:48.240
If you finish it so early,

11:48.260 --> 11:49.680
it will just gather dust.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.610
It's not that early.

11:53.630 --> 11:54.320
What?

11:55.610 --> 11:57.450
I said it's not that early.

11:57.630 --> 11:58.630
Years go by

11:58.650 --> 11:59.930
so fast.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.620
Look at you,

12:00.620 --> 12:02.520
all grown up in the blink of an eye.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.500
I'm old now.

12:05.870 --> 12:07.480
I've become a burden to you.

12:07.870 --> 12:08.710
Grandma!

12:09.920 --> 12:11.420
Don't ever say that again.

12:12.270 --> 12:12.910
Okay.

12:14.210 --> 12:15.980
Here, have an apple.

12:17.510 --> 12:19.510
I've got the medical bills covered.

12:20.470 --> 12:21.510
Once we find a matching

12:21.510 --> 12:22.440
kidney donor,

12:22.560 --> 12:24.160
we'll get the surgery done,

12:24.370 --> 12:25.770
and then you'll recover.

12:25.850 --> 12:27.370
Everything will be fine.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.100
Can we talk about something else?

12:34.690 --> 12:35.760
Like what?

12:37.150 --> 12:38.670
How is that young man

12:38.670 --> 12:39.930
named Lu treating you?

12:42.400 --> 12:43.210
Pretty good.

12:45.040 --> 12:46.100
He takes care of me.

12:46.570 --> 12:47.950
How did you meet?

12:49.500 --> 12:50.900
Didn't I tell you?

12:51.100 --> 12:52.260
We're classmates.

12:53.640 --> 12:55.360
You two don't seem like

12:55.360 --> 12:56.440
just classmates.

13:00.490 --> 13:01.690
I don't know if it's a coincidence

13:01.690 --> 13:02.440
or a mistake.

13:04.030 --> 13:05.220
You like him.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.350
Grandma!

13:06.690 --> 13:08.100
Don't be shy.

13:08.300 --> 13:09.580
You're still young.

13:09.600 --> 13:11.300
There are many things

13:11.320 --> 13:12.520
waiting for you to do.

13:12.570 --> 13:13.690
Don't spend all your time

13:13.690 --> 13:15.160
stuck in the hospital.

13:15.270 --> 13:16.630
If you really like him,

13:16.650 --> 13:18.160
you should follow your heart.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.160
Go find him.

13:19.200 --> 13:20.510
Enjoy this

13:20.510 --> 13:22.150
pure affection.

13:22.610 --> 13:24.070
Did he say anything to you?

13:24.840 --> 13:26.910
He didn't say anything.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.390
But I can tell

13:29.790 --> 13:31.510
he likes you too.

13:33.670 --> 13:35.000
If you think

13:35.000 --> 13:36.650
he's someone you can count on,

13:36.650 --> 13:37.740
just tell me,

13:37.820 --> 13:39.620
and I'll kick you out right away.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.700
Why would you kick me out?

13:42.510 --> 13:43.120
You know,

13:43.120 --> 13:44.780
you nag me every day.

13:44.800 --> 13:45.320
Like nonstop.

13:45.320 --> 13:47.050
-It's annoying.
-I'll keep nagging.

13:47.050 --> 13:48.980
I'll nag you for the rest of my life.

13:49.390 --> 13:50.650
I'm sticking with you.

13:51.320 --> 13:52.600
I'm not going anywhere.

13:52.600 --> 13:53.170
Okay.

13:53.790 --> 13:54.390
Don't go.

13:55.020 --> 13:55.660
Stay.

13:57.220 --> 13:58.470
You can't leave me.

14:00.250 --> 14:00.940
I won't.

14:02.570 --> 14:03.240
I won't.

14:05.190 --> 14:06.240
All this top-notch gear

14:06.240 --> 14:07.030
and expensive parts—

14:07.030 --> 14:08.840
you're just selling it like this?

14:08.840 --> 14:09.440
Why not

14:09.440 --> 14:11.360
-give me a few parts?
-Your feet.

14:12.480 --> 14:14.300
Why sell it cheap to Ping?

14:14.510 --> 14:15.360
He's so old.

14:15.360 --> 14:16.910
Riding a cruiser is enough.

14:16.910 --> 14:18.550
A sportbike just doesn't suit him.

14:18.550 --> 14:19.840
So what if I'm old?

14:20.080 --> 14:20.720
Even if I can't ride it,

14:20.720 --> 14:22.200
can't I collect it?

14:22.290 --> 14:23.120
It's not suitable.

14:23.120 --> 14:23.790
None of your business.

14:23.790 --> 14:24.440
I want it.

14:25.080 --> 14:25.840
But Xixiao,

14:25.860 --> 14:26.600
why are you

14:26.600 --> 14:28.030
selling your bike suddenly?

14:28.030 --> 14:29.030
I'm going abroad.

14:29.050 --> 14:30.080
The procedures are too troublesome.

14:30.080 --> 14:30.730
Xixiao.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.510
You were painting just fine.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.530
Why go abroad now?

14:32.560 --> 14:34.720
-And why did you give this to Ping?
-Sign here.

14:34.720 --> 14:35.630
You used to

14:35.630 --> 14:36.740
give it straight to me.

14:36.740 --> 14:38.000
Why sell it this time?

14:38.120 --> 14:38.840
I can deal with it

14:38.840 --> 14:39.840
however I want.

14:40.790 --> 14:41.270
Ping,

14:41.290 --> 14:42.880
give me the money as soon as it's sold.

14:42.880 --> 14:43.760
Xixiao.

14:43.910 --> 14:46.390
-I'm leaving.
-Give it to me if you don't want it.

14:46.390 --> 14:47.030
Xixiao!

14:48.550 --> 14:49.630
He's not selling the bike.

14:49.630 --> 14:51.230
He's clearly short of money.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.670
Him? Short of money?

14:52.700 --> 14:53.790
Can't you see that?

14:56.200 --> 14:57.630
Bed 23's blood pressure and blood sugar

14:57.630 --> 14:58.440
have stabilized, right?

14:58.440 --> 14:59.700
Yes, they are stable for now.

14:59.700 --> 15:00.840
Then let's schedule

15:00.840 --> 15:01.750
the surgery for next Wednesday.

15:01.750 --> 15:02.240
Okay.

15:02.350 --> 15:02.840
Alright.

15:02.840 --> 15:03.510
Dr. Chen.

15:05.380 --> 15:05.860
Wan.

15:05.890 --> 15:07.150
Okay, you two go ahead.

15:08.660 --> 15:09.660
Excuse me.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.440
How is the kidney match

15:12.470 --> 15:13.200
for my Grandma going?

15:13.200 --> 15:13.950
Don't worry about that.

15:13.950 --> 15:15.190
She's already on the waiting list.

15:15.190 --> 15:15.950
I'll let you know

15:15.950 --> 15:17.280
as soon as there's news.

15:18.290 --> 15:19.200
Thank you.

15:20.320 --> 15:21.000
What's wrong?

15:21.000 --> 15:22.600
You seem a bit down.

15:23.440 --> 15:25.300
You need to take care of yourself,

15:25.370 --> 15:26.150
or your friend

15:26.150 --> 15:27.440
will worry about you.

15:29.000 --> 15:30.530
Did Jiang Yan come by again?

15:31.140 --> 15:31.940
Not Jiang Yan.

15:32.390 --> 15:33.240
It was a

15:33.700 --> 15:34.660
tall guy

15:34.680 --> 15:36.140
without wearing glasses.

15:39.070 --> 15:40.080
Lu Xixiao.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.060
That should be him.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.140
He cares about you a lot.

15:44.140 --> 15:46.130
He kept asking about the surgery fees.

15:46.130 --> 15:47.880
300,000 is not a small amount.

15:48.540 --> 15:51.120
He probably wants to help you out.

15:52.820 --> 15:53.950
I'll leave you to it.

16:14.160 --> 16:15.220
[Nurse Station]

16:15.300 --> 16:17.300
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

16:19.200 --> 16:20.260
Where's Lu Xixiao?

16:21.240 --> 16:22.340
Why ask me? How would I know?

16:22.340 --> 16:23.540
I was going to ask you.

16:24.140 --> 16:25.600
Then what's with the bike?

16:25.750 --> 16:26.600
He said he's going abroad.

16:26.600 --> 16:28.800
He couldn't take the bike, so he sold it.

16:28.900 --> 16:30.180
He's going abroad?

16:30.520 --> 16:31.960
Yeah. Didn't he tell you?

16:31.990 --> 16:32.850
Where is he now?

16:33.630 --> 16:35.080
Probably at the arcade.

16:40.620 --> 16:41.630
[Class Group Chat]

16:41.700 --> 16:42.540
[Who's that?]

16:42.560 --> 16:43.520
[Someone's about to jump.]

16:43.550 --> 16:44.540
[Should we call the police?]

16:44.570 --> 16:45.580
[Probably didn't do well on the exam.]

16:45.610 --> 16:46.260
[I saw it when I passed by.]

16:46.290 --> 16:47.000
[It's so high.
She'll die if she jumps off.]

16:49.270 --> 16:51.030
[Why is Lu Xixiao there too?]

16:54.200 --> 16:55.130
Don't come over.

16:57.000 --> 16:57.960
You don't understand

16:57.960 --> 16:58.790
my pain at all.

16:59.200 --> 17:00.600
Don't take another step.

17:20.390 --> 17:21.319
Don't come over.

17:23.150 --> 17:24.240
You don't understand

17:24.240 --> 17:25.069
my pain at all.

17:27.510 --> 17:29.110
Don't take another step.

17:33.540 --> 17:34.330
Don't.

17:34.600 --> 17:35.850
Step back!

17:36.200 --> 17:36.880
Everyone get back!

17:36.880 --> 17:38.680
Step back!

17:38.720 --> 17:39.230
Everyone get back!

17:39.230 --> 17:39.880
Step back!

17:39.900 --> 17:40.650
Everyone get back!

17:40.650 --> 17:42.520
Step back!

17:42.660 --> 17:43.520
Step back!

17:44.080 --> 17:45.110
Everyone get back!

17:45.110 --> 17:45.720
What are you doing?

17:45.720 --> 17:47.120
Come back!

17:48.680 --> 17:49.660
So you jump.

17:50.700 --> 17:51.700
And then what?

17:54.820 --> 17:55.650
Then...

18:00.030 --> 18:02.090
Once you're dead, there is no "then."

18:03.270 --> 18:05.740
I don't have a future anymore.

18:22.560 --> 18:23.370
Mom.

18:30.120 --> 18:30.990
Go

18:31.750 --> 18:32.400
live your own life

18:32.400 --> 18:33.960
from now on.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.320
No.

18:42.340 --> 18:43.420
Calm down first.

19:06.420 --> 19:07.380
Lu Xixiao!

19:16.490 --> 19:17.500
Calm down first.

19:38.710 --> 19:39.890
What's going on?

19:43.010 --> 19:43.990
Xue Xi?

19:47.150 --> 19:48.300
You know me?

19:50.030 --> 19:51.310
I saw you once when I was on duty

19:51.310 --> 19:52.370
at the school gate.

19:52.540 --> 19:53.400
I thought your short hair

19:53.400 --> 19:54.680
was really pretty.

19:54.720 --> 19:56.320
It left a strong impression.

19:59.510 --> 20:01.160
He said the same thing.

20:01.820 --> 20:03.060
But what's the point?

20:03.910 --> 20:05.930
His parents told us to break up,

20:06.730 --> 20:08.680
and he just did it.

20:09.120 --> 20:10.300
You're still young.

20:11.320 --> 20:11.830
Your future

20:11.830 --> 20:13.440
still holds so much.

20:14.050 --> 20:15.580
Just come down first, okay?

20:15.640 --> 20:17.240
It's too dangerous up there.

20:17.350 --> 20:19.650
What future do I have?

20:19.880 --> 20:21.400
I'm not like you.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.260
My grades are bad.

20:23.540 --> 20:24.880
I'm not pretty.

20:26.750 --> 20:27.750
I don't have the future

20:27.750 --> 20:29.150
or the life that you have.

20:30.320 --> 20:32.040
My mom only forces me

20:32.730 --> 20:33.730
and controls me.

20:34.640 --> 20:35.830
If I don't do what she says,

20:35.830 --> 20:37.350
she hits me and yells at me.

20:37.510 --> 20:38.400
I'm nothing but

20:38.400 --> 20:39.640
her accessory!

20:42.590 --> 20:43.550
And now?

20:44.570 --> 20:46.200
I've lost even the last bit

20:46.200 --> 20:47.000
of hope.

20:48.600 --> 20:49.560
I'm so tired.

20:51.920 --> 20:53.040
You envy me?

20:54.270 --> 20:55.960
I envy all of you.

21:00.380 --> 21:01.590
My dad left when I

21:01.590 --> 21:02.250
was little.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.900
He was drowning in debt.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.920
Everyone called him a deadbeat.

21:07.460 --> 21:08.790
My mom couldn't take it,

21:09.290 --> 21:11.090
so she abandoned me and left too.

21:12.050 --> 21:13.000
When I saw her again

21:13.000 --> 21:14.030
years later,

21:14.630 --> 21:16.440
she pretended not to know me,

21:16.540 --> 21:17.720
like she never had

21:17.720 --> 21:18.720
a daughter at all.

21:20.370 --> 21:22.370
Then my grandma fell seriously ill.

21:22.930 --> 21:25.380
I missed the college entrance exam
due to an accident.

21:24.090 --> 21:24.810
[Admission Ticket]

21:27.540 --> 21:28.220
You see.

21:29.650 --> 21:31.110
All those things you envy,

21:32.120 --> 21:33.980
I actually don't have any of them.

21:35.990 --> 21:38.050
I've tried everything to make money.

21:38.940 --> 21:40.360
I got scholarships

21:40.680 --> 21:41.680
just to make

21:41.700 --> 21:42.620
my grandma's life

21:42.620 --> 21:44.020
a little easier.

21:44.730 --> 21:46.390
But I've been lying all along.

21:46.590 --> 21:47.920
I lied to a lot of people.

21:48.390 --> 21:49.550
I've even

21:51.340 --> 21:52.880
hurt people

21:54.000 --> 21:55.110
who matter to me.

21:57.940 --> 21:58.750
Xue Xi.

21:59.900 --> 22:01.080
You think I want

22:01.100 --> 22:03.430
my own future and life?

22:04.950 --> 22:06.580
I don't even dare to dream.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.190
I'm just like you.

22:10.370 --> 22:11.620
I used to think,

22:11.650 --> 22:13.250
maybe I should just let it go,

22:13.460 --> 22:14.990
maybe I should just give up,

22:15.240 --> 22:16.370
and leave it at that.

22:17.020 --> 22:18.580
But then I thought of my dad,

22:19.110 --> 22:20.240
my grandma,

22:21.150 --> 22:22.880
and all the people I care about.

22:24.680 --> 22:26.290
I don't want to let them down.

22:28.150 --> 22:29.370
And I believe

22:30.450 --> 22:32.650
we have more possibilities ahead of us.

22:33.230 --> 22:34.300
Come down first.

22:35.300 --> 22:37.180
We'll figure it out together.

22:40.190 --> 22:41.230
Xue Xi.

22:42.780 --> 22:43.900
I believe

22:45.150 --> 22:46.500
you can do it.

22:47.500 --> 22:49.100
Just hold on a little longer.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.720
Just a little longer.

22:58.800 --> 22:59.400
Okay?

23:16.480 --> 23:18.110
Make way!

23:18.110 --> 23:19.020
Step back.

23:19.230 --> 23:20.030
This is her family.

23:20.030 --> 23:20.960
That's her daughter up there.

23:20.960 --> 23:22.590
My daughter is up there!

23:23.260 --> 23:25.060
Xi! Xi!

23:25.080 --> 23:25.800
Don't!

23:25.830 --> 23:26.930
Xue Xi.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.490
Don't come up!

23:28.640 --> 23:30.310
Xi! Don't!

23:30.330 --> 23:31.700
Don't come up!

23:31.820 --> 23:33.380
Don't jump!

23:33.410 --> 23:34.370
Don't come up!

23:34.400 --> 23:35.110
Xue Xi.

23:35.130 --> 23:36.080
Don't touch me!

23:36.100 --> 23:36.920
If you touch me,

23:36.920 --> 23:37.920
I'll jump!

23:37.990 --> 23:39.830
I won't touch you. I won't move.

23:40.850 --> 23:41.890
Just calm down.

23:43.060 --> 23:44.110
Calm down.

23:46.720 --> 23:49.860
Don't jump, okay?

23:49.880 --> 23:50.940
I'll stay with you.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.200
I'll go with you

23:52.200 --> 23:53.560
to talk to your mother.

23:53.580 --> 23:54.210
Okay?

23:54.240 --> 23:56.710
It's useless. Useless!

23:56.950 --> 23:57.950
If I go down,

23:57.970 --> 24:00.570
she'll still hit me and yell at me!

24:00.960 --> 24:03.160
She just doesn't understand anything!

24:03.270 --> 24:04.790
What do you want?

24:04.810 --> 24:06.980
I'll do anything you ask!

24:09.050 --> 24:09.960
What about him?

24:12.660 --> 24:14.270
Do you really like him?

24:16.910 --> 24:17.760
Xue Xi!

24:17.780 --> 24:19.500
Xi! Don't!

24:19.520 --> 24:21.960
He's just a coward.

24:22.860 --> 24:24.580
If you really jump today,

24:25.990 --> 24:28.250
what about the people who care about you?

24:28.390 --> 24:29.700
How would they feel?

24:33.380 --> 24:34.990
You'll become an indelible

24:36.400 --> 24:37.810
shadow in their hearts.

24:39.570 --> 24:42.300
At least you still have
people who care about you,

24:44.590 --> 24:45.220
don't you?

24:49.750 --> 24:51.030
My mom back then was exactly

24:51.030 --> 24:52.050
like you are now.

24:56.180 --> 24:57.780
Standing right on that edge.

25:06.480 --> 25:08.260
She jumped right in front of me.

25:09.290 --> 25:10.680
I still can't forget

25:10.680 --> 25:11.940
that scene to this day.

25:15.120 --> 25:16.720
I see it every single time

25:16.720 --> 25:17.920
I close my eyes.

25:18.830 --> 25:20.620
So I'm begging you.

25:21.320 --> 25:22.880
While you still have a choice,

25:22.880 --> 25:24.030
don't leave the people

25:24.030 --> 25:24.880
who love you and the people you love

25:24.880 --> 25:26.070
with that as their last image

25:26.070 --> 25:27.310
of you. Okay?

25:37.030 --> 25:38.690
While you still have a choice,

25:42.450 --> 25:43.850
you can still start over.

25:48.210 --> 25:55.190
[Public Security]

25:52.930 --> 25:54.720
Come on, everyone step back!

25:54.790 --> 25:55.990
Everyone step back!

25:56.970 --> 25:58.680
-Hurry up. Please leave first.
-I'll leave.

25:58.680 --> 25:59.740
Leave first, okay?

25:59.740 --> 26:00.680
Third floor, over here.

26:00.680 --> 26:01.720
Stop filming.

26:04.790 --> 26:05.880
The world is big.

26:07.300 --> 26:08.480
The future is long.

26:09.990 --> 26:11.450
There are so many pages

26:12.430 --> 26:14.250
in the story of your life

26:14.490 --> 26:15.700
you haven't read yet.

26:17.970 --> 26:19.270
Come down first, okay?

26:20.240 --> 26:20.880
We'll help you

26:20.880 --> 26:22.340
figure this out together.

26:29.830 --> 26:31.110
Come down first.

26:31.750 --> 26:32.680
Come down first.

26:39.220 --> 26:40.480
Don't come any closer.

26:41.020 --> 26:41.980
Stop talking.

26:42.070 --> 26:43.840
Stop talking!

26:45.930 --> 26:46.720
No!

27:08.730 --> 27:10.000
Let go, Zhou Wan.

27:10.050 --> 27:11.060
You can't hold on.

27:41.020 --> 27:42.520
Zhou Wan!

27:42.540 --> 27:43.570
Don't grab my hand.

27:43.570 --> 27:44.460
I need to examine you.

27:44.460 --> 27:45.390
Just cooperate.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.600
Where's Zhou Wan?

27:48.030 --> 27:49.220
The girl who came with you,

27:49.220 --> 27:49.790
right?

27:49.820 --> 27:50.650
She's fine.

27:50.670 --> 27:51.350
She was still conscious

27:51.350 --> 27:52.240
when she fell.

27:52.240 --> 27:53.440
She's getting examined now.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.720
You don't need to examine me.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.680
Doctor, I'm fine.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.740
Where is that girl?

27:57.400 --> 27:58.680
On the third floor.

27:58.760 --> 28:00.420
Which room on the third floor?

28:00.550 --> 28:01.150
Hey,

28:01.270 --> 28:02.110
can't you even wait

28:02.110 --> 28:03.270
for this little while?

28:03.270 --> 28:03.920
Just stay here

28:03.920 --> 28:04.680
and cooperate with the exam.

28:04.680 --> 28:05.410
Stop moving.

28:05.790 --> 28:06.960
I'm really fine, doctor.

28:06.960 --> 28:07.550
Just tell me

28:07.550 --> 28:08.750
which room she's in.

28:08.750 --> 28:10.000
-I beg you.
-Room 302!

28:10.000 --> 28:10.530
Room 302.

28:11.280 --> 28:12.410
Where are you going?

28:12.830 --> 28:14.200
The exam isn't done yet!

28:14.220 --> 28:15.210
Thanks, doctor.

28:20.820 --> 28:24.190
[Room 302]

28:23.190 --> 28:24.820
What's the problem?

28:24.960 --> 28:26.160
I can't sleep.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.530
For how long?

28:27.260 --> 28:28.900
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

28:28.110 --> 28:29.170
Almost two months.

28:29.790 --> 28:30.520
Two months.

28:30.630 --> 28:32.070
Anything happen recently?

28:30.830 --> 28:32.030
♪ An astronomer ♪

28:34.210 --> 28:35.070
Excuse me.

28:35.070 --> 28:35.750
Was there a girl

28:35.160 --> 28:36.630
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

28:35.750 --> 28:37.110
named Zhou Wan here?

28:37.430 --> 28:39.200
She already finished and left.

28:38.640 --> 28:40.970
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

28:43.190 --> 28:45.020
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

28:46.690 --> 28:48.700
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

28:47.440 --> 28:47.960
You...

28:49.070 --> 28:50.820
[Neurosurgery & Psychology Clinics]

28:50.210 --> 28:52.580
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

28:50.310 --> 28:50.960
Miss,

28:51.000 --> 28:51.590
are you looking for

28:51.590 --> 28:52.990
the boy who came with you?

28:54.130 --> 28:57.690
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

28:54.200 --> 28:54.830
Yes.

28:54.850 --> 28:56.460
He just finished his exam and left.

28:56.460 --> 28:57.500
Already left?

28:58.080 --> 28:59.400
Never seen someone so scared of heights.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.310
You were fine,

29:00.350 --> 29:01.670
but he passed out.

29:01.030 --> 29:02.300
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

29:01.700 --> 29:03.030
Where did he go?

29:02.930 --> 29:04.300
♪ No time left, so I ♪

29:03.160 --> 29:04.050
I didn't see it.

29:05.110 --> 29:07.010
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

29:05.850 --> 29:07.360
Thank you.

29:06.110 --> 29:13.570
[Neurosurgery & Psychology Clinics]

29:09.080 --> 29:11.770
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

29:11.930 --> 29:15.350
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

29:13.200 --> 29:13.790
Excuse me,

29:13.790 --> 29:14.830
was there a girl

29:14.830 --> 29:16.160
named Zhou Wan here just now?

29:16.160 --> 29:16.960
She just left.

29:16.990 --> 29:17.640
Just left?

29:17.220 --> 29:19.650
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

29:18.920 --> 29:21.140
[Neurosurgery & Psychology Clinics]

29:19.750 --> 29:23.150
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

29:25.200 --> 29:26.690
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

29:26.710 --> 29:29.410
♪ This mud all over me ♪

29:30.130 --> 29:32.760
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

29:49.110 --> 29:50.860
♪ I can't remember and can't go back ♪

29:51.000 --> 29:53.070
♪ If you can't hold it tightly, let me ♪

29:53.180 --> 29:55.340
♪ Fly without hesitation ♪

29:57.150 --> 29:59.840
♪ Sorry, I'm too capricious and obsessed ♪

29:57.230 --> 29:57.910
Zhou Wan!

30:00.000 --> 30:03.100
♪ The Milky Way is drowning ♪

30:05.270 --> 30:07.910
♪ If one day you fall into ♪

30:07.980 --> 30:11.230
♪ The gap a light-year away ♪

30:15.080 --> 30:16.780
♪ You'll find ♪

30:16.990 --> 30:18.970
♪ The scattered ashes ♪

30:20.670 --> 30:26.360
♪ Burns my heart ♪

30:23.100 --> 30:24.700
-Are you okay?
-Are you ok...

30:28.310 --> 30:29.110
The doctor said I just have

30:29.110 --> 30:30.440
a slight muscle strain.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.390
I'll be fine after some rest.

30:35.840 --> 30:36.560
Me too.

30:37.250 --> 30:38.050
You're lying.

30:39.160 --> 30:39.960
The doctor told me

30:39.960 --> 30:41.820
you have a severe fear of heights.

30:48.080 --> 30:49.660
Just now on the rooftop, you...

30:49.660 --> 30:50.720
Let me speak first.

30:53.720 --> 30:55.140
There is something

30:55.570 --> 30:57.290
I don't want to hide anymore.

31:00.290 --> 31:02.090
Guo Xiangling is not my sponsor.

31:03.170 --> 31:04.770
She is my biological mother.

31:07.230 --> 31:08.040
I know.

31:10.410 --> 31:11.480
Actually, I've been hoping

31:11.480 --> 31:12.480
you would tell me.

31:13.410 --> 31:14.530
You never did.

31:16.670 --> 31:18.400
But it doesn't matter anymore.

31:18.780 --> 31:20.240
After all, you held on to me

31:23.130 --> 31:24.020
up there,

31:28.120 --> 31:28.800
didn't you?

31:33.910 --> 31:34.860
Lu Xixiao.

31:35.480 --> 31:37.350
Next time you plan to die,
give me a heads-up first.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.400
Otherwise, I won't have time

31:38.400 --> 31:40.400
to arrange a proper funeral for you.

31:41.130 --> 31:41.870
Auntie.

31:42.000 --> 31:42.840
Can I borrow him for a moment?

31:42.840 --> 31:43.370
I...

31:46.900 --> 31:51.620
[Children's Medical Center]
[Registration & Payment]
[Outpatient Pharmacy]

31:49.230 --> 31:50.080
Zhou Wan!

31:57.170 --> 31:58.160
Are you even

31:58.160 --> 31:59.110
listening to me?

32:01.350 --> 32:02.000
You brat.

32:02.000 --> 32:04.060
You're not gonna jump again, are you?

32:04.210 --> 32:06.030
My head hurts already.

32:06.030 --> 32:07.200
Give me a break.

32:09.640 --> 32:10.900
Who would've thought?

32:12.720 --> 32:14.050
Now that I'm in trouble,

32:14.950 --> 32:17.750
you're the only one in the family
who came to see me.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.570
Feeling down?

32:21.310 --> 32:22.240
Did you only just

32:22.240 --> 32:23.400
realize today what

32:23.400 --> 32:25.460
your family relationships are like?

32:26.350 --> 32:28.120
So if you go abroad,

32:28.200 --> 32:29.530
your dad'll be happy,

32:29.720 --> 32:31.110
grandpa'll be happy,

32:31.260 --> 32:33.110
and Guo Xiangling, of course—

32:33.130 --> 32:34.400
she's finally marrying into the family.

32:34.400 --> 32:36.800
She's probably popping champagne at home.

32:39.550 --> 32:40.510
So, me leaving

32:40.510 --> 32:41.240
is a win for

32:41.240 --> 32:42.440
everyone, huh?

32:42.690 --> 32:43.900
Of course.

32:44.010 --> 32:45.910
The whole world will be happy.

32:46.240 --> 32:47.350
So go already.

32:47.370 --> 32:48.770
What are you waiting for?

32:53.000 --> 32:53.890
Waiting...

32:58.850 --> 33:00.310
to say goodbye to someone.

33:05.790 --> 33:06.920
Thank you, Zhou Wan.

33:08.570 --> 33:10.320
I'm going to start over,

33:10.350 --> 33:11.950
and go to college out of town.

33:13.000 --> 33:15.050
Congratulations, Xue Xi.

33:15.480 --> 33:16.310
Thank you.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.000
So,

33:19.510 --> 33:21.000
you and that guy...

33:25.510 --> 33:27.310
We decided to break up after all.

33:28.960 --> 33:29.720
Maybe

33:30.160 --> 33:32.620
our personalities just aren't compatible.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.640
Perhaps

33:35.270 --> 33:36.240
incompatible personalities

33:36.240 --> 33:38.040
aren't necessarily a bad thing.

33:39.110 --> 33:40.910
Just like you and that Lu Xixiao?

33:41.680 --> 33:42.900
I think you two

33:43.200 --> 33:44.460
are quite a good match.

33:46.110 --> 33:47.270
He and I

33:47.270 --> 33:48.680
are not what you think.

33:51.310 --> 33:52.200
As for you,

33:52.830 --> 33:54.480
don't be so impulsive next time.

33:54.480 --> 33:56.590
Never hurt yourself over a breakup,

33:57.310 --> 33:58.310
or

33:59.400 --> 34:01.680
because of some guy.

34:02.350 --> 34:04.080
There's so much more out there.

34:06.880 --> 34:08.880
It wasn't really about the breakup.

34:09.400 --> 34:10.590
After going through so much,

34:10.590 --> 34:12.440
you should be able to understand.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.670
I just feel like

34:14.510 --> 34:16.360
maybe everyone has

34:16.360 --> 34:17.889
their own burdens to carry.

34:21.150 --> 34:23.290
[Time Store]

34:37.480 --> 34:39.139
Why did you want to come swing?

34:43.710 --> 34:44.670
Because

34:48.150 --> 34:48.920
I used to come here

34:48.920 --> 34:49.850
with my mom a lot.

34:52.360 --> 34:53.550
Today I guess I'm

34:56.010 --> 34:58.270
remembering some things from back then.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.230
Actually,

35:04.920 --> 35:05.510
I only became

35:05.510 --> 35:06.630
afraid of heights

35:07.550 --> 35:08.680
after my mom jumped.

35:17.620 --> 35:18.260
It's fine.

35:23.220 --> 35:24.320
I want you to know everything

35:24.320 --> 35:25.230
before I leave.

35:28.600 --> 35:29.860
And you're the only one

35:31.720 --> 35:32.510
who can ask.

35:45.150 --> 35:45.760
So,

35:47.710 --> 35:49.070
what really happened?

35:56.560 --> 35:58.220
My maternal grandparents

35:58.920 --> 36:00.850
came from aristocratic families.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.000
My mom

36:02.000 --> 36:03.660
was sheltered her whole life.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.890
After she graduated and returned,

36:08.250 --> 36:09.490
she met Lu Zhongyue

36:09.850 --> 36:10.980
at a cocktail party.

36:12.050 --> 36:13.510
It was love at first sight.

36:15.900 --> 36:17.070
At that time, my maternal grandparents

36:17.070 --> 36:18.760
also tried to set them up.

36:19.440 --> 36:20.480
My paternal grandfather
also highly favored

36:20.480 --> 36:21.340
this marriage.

36:23.590 --> 36:25.120
He made the final decision.

36:26.510 --> 36:28.510
And they got married 3 months later.

36:30.880 --> 36:31.760
Their wedding

36:33.400 --> 36:35.230
was front-page news

36:35.230 --> 36:37.510
in Pingchuan back then.

36:40.150 --> 36:42.020
Lu Zhongyue used that marriage

36:42.400 --> 36:42.840
to change my grandpa's

36:42.840 --> 36:43.920
opinion of him.

36:45.710 --> 36:46.670
He gradually started

36:46.670 --> 36:48.070
taking over the company.

36:49.800 --> 36:50.510
My mother, on the other hand,

36:50.510 --> 36:52.170
spent most of her time at home,

36:52.230 --> 36:53.880
painting and writing poems.

36:53.430 --> 36:56.150
[Happy Wedding. A Lifetime of Joy.]

36:55.870 --> 36:57.730
It was said to be a very happy time.

36:59.540 --> 37:00.960
At least it seemed so.

37:00.130 --> 37:06.050
[Happy Wedding. A Lifetime of Joy.]

37:02.710 --> 37:04.370
Soon, my mother got pregnant.

37:07.080 --> 37:08.680
You know what happened next.

37:13.450 --> 37:15.280
Lu Zhongyue hid it very well,

37:17.690 --> 37:18.710
until my mother found out

37:18.710 --> 37:19.670
about Jiang Yan.

37:21.430 --> 37:22.810
She was always

37:23.440 --> 37:24.480
strong-willed

37:24.480 --> 37:26.000
and proud in everything.

37:28.590 --> 37:29.320
It was

37:31.240 --> 37:32.070
bad enough that her own marriage

37:32.070 --> 37:33.400
was in ruins.

37:34.000 --> 37:35.130
And she realized...

37:38.280 --> 37:40.010
she was the one who came second.

37:42.090 --> 37:43.030
She just couldn't

37:43.030 --> 37:44.070
accept the fact.

37:47.280 --> 37:49.540
Actually, it wasn't that bad initially.

37:51.710 --> 37:53.710
She just wanted to leave the family.

38:04.670 --> 38:05.920
It wasn't until she sent me

38:05.920 --> 38:06.630
to stay with

38:06.630 --> 38:07.760
my grandparents

38:09.840 --> 38:11.370
that I found out from my aunt

38:13.060 --> 38:14.190
what really happened

38:14.190 --> 38:15.030
back then.

38:22.510 --> 38:23.230
Lan?

38:25.840 --> 38:26.550
Lan?

38:29.440 --> 38:30.030
What are you doing

38:30.030 --> 38:31.090
hiding here alone?

38:33.590 --> 38:35.050
Where did you take Xixiao?

38:38.150 --> 38:38.880
What is this?

38:56.760 --> 38:58.160
You had me investigated?

39:00.940 --> 39:02.200
After all these years,

39:03.030 --> 39:04.000
what else don't I

39:04.000 --> 39:05.030
know about you?

39:14.590 --> 39:18.070
[Divorce Agreement]

39:21.060 --> 39:22.810
I will never divorce you.

39:23.710 --> 39:25.070
But I can promise you,

39:27.400 --> 39:28.690
I can leave all of them.

39:30.520 --> 39:31.710
You even had

39:31.710 --> 39:33.170
a child with someone else!

39:33.410 --> 39:34.920
When she got pregnant,

39:34.920 --> 39:35.800
I had no idea.

39:35.800 --> 39:36.590
By the time I found out,

39:36.590 --> 39:37.280
it was too late.

39:37.280 --> 39:38.920
The child was already born.

39:39.540 --> 39:40.990
What was I supposed to do?

39:41.760 --> 39:43.090
What do you want me to do?

39:43.830 --> 39:44.920
All I can promise you is that

39:44.920 --> 39:46.230
this child will never

39:46.230 --> 39:47.690
come near Xixiao!

39:54.760 --> 39:55.890
She wanted to leave,

39:57.030 --> 39:58.030
but she couldn't.

39:59.670 --> 40:01.200
Later, she got depression.

40:02.970 --> 40:03.880
At first, the family didn't agree

40:03.880 --> 40:05.810
to let me continue living with her.

40:06.110 --> 40:07.670
I begged Grandpa desperately

40:07.670 --> 40:10.000
just to be able to visit her occasionally.

40:12.010 --> 40:13.030
And then...

40:15.030 --> 40:15.920
Mom!

40:19.560 --> 40:20.490
Xixiao.

40:22.090 --> 40:23.080
From now on,

40:23.880 --> 40:25.760
go live your own life.

40:44.320 --> 40:45.160
Lu Xixiao.

40:47.030 --> 40:47.880
You know what?

40:50.830 --> 40:52.060
My dad told me that

40:54.760 --> 40:55.840
kind people

40:57.000 --> 40:58.360
always go to heaven.

41:01.760 --> 41:02.840
I believe your mother

41:02.840 --> 41:04.170
is definitely up there,

41:05.210 --> 41:06.270
watching over you,

41:07.260 --> 41:08.180
always by your side.
